flowchart TD
  Dev[Developer creates feature branch] --> PR[Open PR to main]
  PR --> TestWF[Testing workflow]
  TestWF -->|build + test + lint| DeployTest[Deploy to Testing EC2]
  DeployTest --> QA[QA validates changes]
  QA --> Merge[Merge to main]
  Merge --> StagingWF[Staging workflow]
  StagingWF -->|build + test + lint| DeployStage[Deploy to Staging EC2]
  TestWF -->|notify| EmailFail[Email on failure]
  DeployTest -->|notify| EmailSuccess[Email on success]
  StagingWF -->|notify| EmailFail
  DeployStage -->|notify| EmailSuccess
